  "title": "The Answer You Never Chose",
  "total_seconds": 45.92,
  "total_mmss": "0:45",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "scene": 2,
      "tone": "rustig",
      "wav": "assets/channels/channel1/voice/chose/v2/02.wav",
      "start": 0.0,
      "dur": 45.92,
      "speech_start": 0.0,
      "speech_end": 45.37,
      "sentences": [
        {
          "i": 0,
          "text": "Now here is what makes that so strange.",
          "start": 0.0,
          "dur": 2.921,
          "abs_start": 0.0
        },
        {
          "i": 1,
          "text": "Think about an animal for a moment.",
          "start": 2.921,
          "dur": 3.512,
          "abs_start": 2.921
        },
        {
          "i": 2,
          "text": "A bird getting ready to fly south does not sit there weighing its options.",
          "start": 6.433,
          "dur": 5.577,
          "abs_start": 6.433
        },
        {
          "i": 3,
          "text": "It does not wonder whether it is making the right call.",
          "start": 12.51,
          "dur": 3.569,
          "abs_start": 12.51
        },
        {
          "i": 4,
          "text": "It just goes, the way it always has.",
          "start": 16.079,
          "dur": 2.515,
          "abs_start": 16.079
        },
        {
          "i": 5,
          "text": "That is instinct, not a decision.",
          "start": 18.595,
          "dur": 2.515,
          "abs_start": 18.595
        },
        {
          "i": 6,
          "text": "You are different.",
          "start": 21.61,
          "dur": 1.239,
          "abs_start": 21.61
        },
        {
          "i": 7,
          "text": "You can stop before you act.",
          "start": 22.849,
          "dur": 1.658,
          "abs_start": 22.849
        },
        {
          "i": 8,
          "text": "You can question what you are doing, and even question the way you are thinking about it.",
          "start": 24.507,
          "dur": 4.933,
          "abs_start": 24.507
        },
        {
          "i": 9,
          "text": "You can reason about things that are not in front of you at all, things you cannot see or touch.",
          "start": 29.94,
          "dur": 5.034,
          "abs_start": 29.94
        },
        {
          "i": 10,
          "text": "You do this constantly, without ever noticing.",
          "start": 34.974,
          "dur": 2.979,
          "abs_start": 34.974
        },
        {
          "i": 11,
          "text": "And it is exactly this ability, the one you lean on all day without a second thought, that the rest of this video is about.",
          "start": 37.953,
          "dur": 7.417,
          "abs_start": 37.953
        }
      ],
      "beats": [],
      "sfx": []
    }
  ]
}